 "summary": "Two PNP small-signal transistors, cut from neighbouring die on one wafer, sit side by side in a six-lead SOT363 package with no pin shared between them. Each takes -40 V collector to emitter and -200 mA collector current. Within the pair, DC gain tracks to 2 % and base-emitter voltage to 2 mV maximum at -2 mA. Listed uses are current mirrors, differential and instrumentation amplifiers, and comparators. DMMT3906W-7-F is the AEC-Q101 part; DMMT3906WQ-7-F is the automotive grade.",
